    "legend": "Loosely cohesive small sheets of atypical cells showing nuclear moulding, limited (often eccentric) cytoplasm in most cells, and hyperchromatic moderately pleomorphic nuclei with fine uniform chromatin and no discernible nucleoli. Some very dark nuclei of degenerating tumour cells are also present (transbronchial FNAB, H&amp;E).",
